  briefing: [
    "A decoded telegram names Teague's judges, freight agents, and killers from Kansas to California. Wen's contact died getting it out of the wire office.",
    "Carry the telegram across the depot before the Ring closes the rail line. If it reaches a newspaper and a federal prosecutor, Teague can no longer contain the story locally.",
  ],
